Covenants written in a low-rate decade now limit what management can do. Many boards discover the constraint only when a strategic opportunity is already on the table.

## Audit the Covenants, Not Just the Coupon

Restrictions on disposals, acquisitions and dividend policy often cost more than interest. A clause-by-clause review shows which ones bind in realistic scenarios.

## Sequence the Refinancing

Staggering maturities and pairing refinancing with operational improvements strengthens the negotiating position with lenders and protects valuation.
